__pycache__/
*.pyc
detectors/checks/_leak_*.pt

# Per-patient / per-stay caches derived from restricted data.
#
# Aggregate results ARE committed, under detectors/results/*.json: confusion
# matrices, kappa values, confidence intervals, t-statistics, flag rates. Those
# are summary numbers, and publishing the code that produced them is required
# by the PhysioNet DUA once the results are disseminated.
#
# Anything at individual-stay granularity is NOT published, even where it is not
# identifying on its own. That is the whole of the exclusion, and it costs
# nothing reproducible: regenerate these caches with your own credentials using
# the commands in detectors/TODO.md section 0.
detectors/results/*.npz
detectors/results/*.pkl
detectors/results/*.pt
